       FD  MCLASS-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MCLASS-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS4900  OF MCFLCS4901.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  MODIFY-STRM-SW                PIC X(1)  VALUE "N".
           88  MODIFY-STRM-DISALLOWED              VALUE "Y".

       01  WDWN-SW                       PIC X(1)  VALUE "N".
           88  WDWN-CLASS-FOUND                    VALUE "Y".
           88  WDWN-CLASS-NOT-FOUND                VALUE "N".

       01  SAVE-AREA-VAR-DEPTS.
