           05  SAVE-RUBBER-DATE          PIC X(6)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-FABRIC-DEPT          PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-FABRIC-DATE          PIC X(6)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-ALL-OTHER-DEPT       PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-ALL-OTHER-DATE       PIC X(6)  VALUE SPACES.

       01  SAVE-AREA-WDWN.
           05  SAVE-WDWN-CLASS OCCURS 10 TIMES
                INDEXED BY WDWN-INDEX
                                         PIC X(3).
       01  INDEX-AREA.
