           05  INDX2                     PIC 9(2)  VALUE 1.
           05  INDX3                     PIC 9(2)  VALUE 1.
           05  RPT-SUB                   PIC 9(2)  VALUE 0.
           05  LEDGER-SUB                PIC 9(2)  VALUE 0.
           05  INTR-SUB                  PIC 9(2)  VALUE 0.

       01  DATE-CHECK.
           05  DATE-CHECK-YY             PIC X(2).
           05  DATE-CHECK-MM             PIC X(2).
           05  DATE-CHECK-DD             PIC X(2).

