           05  FILLER  PIC X(2)  VALUE "01".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(60) VALUE "VOUCHER 21                    ".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(2)  VALUE "02".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(60) VALUE "VOUCHER 24                    ".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(2)  VALUE "04".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(60) VALUE "STORES MATERIAL TO N.W.O.     ".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(2)  VALUE "05".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(60) VALUE "ENGINEERING MATERIAL CHARGES  ".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(2)  VALUE "06".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(60) VALUE "DIRECT CHARGES TO N.W.O.      ".

       01  MREPORT-ENTRIES     REDEFINES   MREPORT-TABLE.
           05  MREPORT-ENTRY  OCCURS  5  TIMES.
